</ul>
</li>
<li><strong>[x] Sub-Class Taxonomy</strong>: Created detailed acoustic profiles for sub-classes (gas vs. electric chainsaws, rifle vs. handgun vs. shotgun, etc.) and excluded boat engine classes per specifications.<ul>
